{
  "_readme": "The default baseline — authentic values except the deliberate defaults: prune_owned_jars ON, fog_distance 50 (faithful 20), hud_transparency off. Generated by mgcarpet; regenerated automatically when the option schema changes (_version). Put your overrides in mgcarpet.json with the same structure.",
